{"title":"Career Roadmap · Packaging Designer","role":"Packaging Designer","summary":"A Packaging Designer creates the structural and visual design of product packaging while balancing brand identity, usability, manufacturing, materials, protection, sustainability, cost, regulations, and consumer experience.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Product / Industrial Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of industrial design, graphic design, materials, manufacturing, branding, and consumer behaviour."},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des Product/Industrial Design","Packaging Design Internship","Junior Packaging Designer","Packaging Designer","Senior Packaging Designer","Packaging Design Lead","Design Director / Packaging Innovation Lead"],"label":"Typical route"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Approx. Timeline","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Design fundamentals + visual communication"}],[{"text":"Product Skills"},{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Materials + CAD + structural design"}],[{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Packaging systems + prototyping"}],[{"text":"Industry Preparation"},{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Internship + portfolio + live projects"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Junior Packaging Designer"}],[{"text":"Growth"},{"text":"3–6 years"},{"text":"Packaging Designer / Senior Designer"}],[{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"6–10 years"},{"text":"Packaging Design Lead"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"10–15 years"},{"text":"Design Manager / Design Director"}],[{"text":"Long-term"},{"text":"15+ years"},{"text":"Packaging Innovation / Creative Leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Design Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build